{"content":[{"c":["ANER (P",{"c":["erson"],"sourceClass":"lc","t":"span"},")"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Amorite ally of Abram and brother of Mamre and Eshcol (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.14.13","r":"Gen.14.13","rawR":"Gen.14.13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.14.13","value":"Gen.14.13"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 14:13"},"). With his brothers, Aner helped Abram defeat a confederation of four kings who had plundered Sodom and Gomorrah and had captured Abram’s nephew Lot (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.14.14-16,21-24","r":"Gen.14.14-16,21-24","rawR":"Gen.14.14-16,21-24","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.14.14-16,21-24","value":"Gen.14.14-16,21-24"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 14:14-16, 21-24"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"AnerPerson","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Gn 14:13","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.14.13","rawQueryValue":"Gen.14.13","sourceRefExact":"Gen.14.13"},{"anchorText":"Gn 14:14-16, 21-24","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.14.14-16,21-24","rawQueryValue":"Gen.14.14-16,21-24","sourceRefExact":"Gen.14.14-16,21-24"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"c857a76cc1724e49acc8f72b398987d9d57df5c95dc3a3beb7d0e31e08562a6e","sourceItemName":"AnerPerson","sourceItemOrder":348,"sourceMember":"Articles/A.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"AnerPerson","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Aner (Person)","title":"Aner (Person)","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}